\pard\b\fs20 Siege of the Coal Mining Town\b0\par
\fs16\par
The coal mining town of Narshe is under siege by imperial troops. The town lies on high ground and is protected by a strong town wall, but the attacker has a steady stream of reinforcements and Magi-Tec technology.\par
}
